187:     /**
188:      * Request an update of the current cluster metadata info, permitting backoff based on the number of
189:      * equivalent metadata responses, which indicates that responses did not make progress and may be stale.
190:      * 
191:      * @param resetEquivalentResponseBackoff Whether to reset backing off based on consecutive equivalent responses.
192:      *                                       This should be set to <i>false</i> in situations where the update is
193:      *                                       being requested to retry an operation, such as when the leader has
194:      *                                       changed. It should be set to <i>true</i> in situations where new
195:      *                                       metadata is being requested, such as adding a topic to a subscription.
196:      *                                       In situations where it's not clear, it's best to use <i>true</i>.
197:      * 
198:      * @return The current updateVersion before the update
199:      */
200:     public synchronized int requestUpdate(final boolean resetEquivalentResponseBackoff) {
201:         this.needFullUpdate = true;
202:         if (resetEquivalentResponseBackoff) {
203:             this.equivalentResponseCount = 0;
204:         }
205:         return this.updateVersion;
206:     }
