626:     /**
627:      * If any non-retriable exceptions were encountered during metadata update, throw exception if the exception
628:      * is fatal or related to the specified topic. All exceptions from the last metadata update are cleared.
629:      * This is used by the producer to propagate topic metadata errors for send requests.
