39: /**
40:  * {@code FetchBuffer} buffers up {@link CompletedFetch the results} from the broker responses as they are received.
41:  * It is essentially a wrapper around a {@link java.util.Queue} of {@link CompletedFetch}. There is at most one
42:  * {@link CompletedFetch} per partition in the queue.
43:  *
