1910:      * will not wait for confirmation of the request creation before continuing.
1911:      *
1912:      * <p/>
1913:      *
1914:      * At the point this method is called, {@link KafkaConsumer#poll(Duration)} has data ready to return to the user,
1915:      * which means the consumed position was already updated. In order to prevent potential gaps in records, this
1916:      * method is designed to suppress all exceptions.
