585:                         "The Hibernate ORM configuration in Quarkus does not support sourcing configuration properties from resources named `hibernate.properties`,"
586:                                 + " and this is now expressly prohibited as such a file could lead to unpredictable semantics. Please remove it from `"
587:                                 + url.toExternalForm() + '`');
